Description: FlickOS security kit: password testing
 John the Ripper, hashcat, Hydra, Medusa, crunch, fcrackzip, pdfcrack and
 hashID from Debian.
 .
 hashcat runs on the processor as installed. To use a graphics card,
 install its maker's OpenCL driver, or mesa-opencl-icd and set
 RUSTICL_ENABLE for the card's driver. Debian has no wordlists, so none
 come with the kit.
 .
 Use these tools only on computers and networks you own or have permission
 to test.
 .
 A kit is installed from Software's Security Tools and removed there too.
 Nothing it installs runs until it is used
 (docs/design/flickos-security.md).
